# Treat 3D-print and image assets as binary: no text diffs, no line-ending
# conversion. Keeps commits readable and avoids ASCII-STL/PNG diff noise.
*.stl   binary
*.3mf   binary
*.step  binary
*.stp   binary
*.obj   binary
*.gcode binary
*.zip   binary

# Images
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
